    "9": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "##### Availability\nA red row while others remain green points to a location-specific issue: check the runner, its network, or its region. A red column across all locations points to a shared cause, such as a deployment, upstream dependency, or application issue. The map requires `test.run.location.lat` and `.lon` on run events."
    },
